blocks.en:
Field deployments in private and RAC homes consistently reveal patterns that improve reliability and acceptance. Across recent studies, four principles stand out:
(i) Schedule interactions rather than relying on ad hoc use, as structured routines improve engagement and predictability;
(ii) provide fast caregiver controls for setup and content customisation, reducing dependence on technical staff;
(iii) enable fallback mechanisms so speech failures revert to large-screen prompts or alternative modalities; and
(iv) instrument operations, including docking success, false speech activations, and alert rates to enable iterative improvement. These patterns create a direct bridge to the evaluation priorities in Section 6 , where reliability, recovery, and workflow fit become measurable outcomes rather than informal observations.
Fig. 5 illustrates four representative robot platforms that recur across residential aged care and home deployments, spanning humanoid service robots, pet-like therapeutic devices, tabletop companions, and mobile telepresence or assistant robots.

blocks.zh:
在私人和RAC之家的实地部署始终显示出改善可靠性和接受性的模式。 在最近的研究中,有四项原则突出:
(一) 安排互动,而不是依靠临时使用,因为结构化的例行程序可以改善接触和可预测性;
(二) 为设置和内容定制提供快速护理人员控制,减少对技术人员的依赖;
(三) 启用倒置机制,使语音故障恢复为大屏幕提示或替代模式;
(四) 仪表操作,包括对接成功,假语音激活,以及警报率,以便进行迭代改进。 这些模式为第6节的评价优先事项提供了直接的桥梁,在该节中,可靠性、恢复性和工作流程适合成为可衡量的成果,而不是非正式的观察。
图5显示了四个具有代表性的机器人平台,这些平台在住宅老年护理和家庭部署中反复出现,包括人造服务机器人、宠物类治疗设备、桌面伴侣和移动远程存在或辅助机器人。

blocks.en:
Within this section, we outline the core privacy risks and corresponding design responses, the mechanisms that build and calibrate trust, and the factors that sustain acceptance over time.
Users need clarity about what the system senses, when it is active, and how decisions are made;
families and clinicians must be able to rely on alerts without the burden of frequent false alarms;
and facility operators must ensure compliance with regional legal and policy frameworks.
These themes connect directly to the interaction patterns in Section 3 and underpin the evaluation lenses explored in Section 6 .
The discussion is informed by recent studies on safe interaction methods ( Zhao et al., 2023 ) , utility and acceptability in home care ( Zhao et al., 2025 ) , and systematic reviews of assistive robot acceptance ( Jones et al., 2025 ) .

blocks.zh:
在本节中,我们概述了核心隐私风险和相应的设计对策,建立和校准信任的机制,以及长期持续接受的因素。
用户需要明确系统的含义、活动时间和如何作出决定;
家人和临床医生必须能够依靠警报,而不必承担频繁的虚假警报的负担;
设施运营商必须确保遵守区域法律和政策框架。
这些主题与第3节的互动模式直接相关,是第6节探讨的评价视角的基础。
讨论参考了最近关于安全互动方法的研究(赵等人,2023年),家庭护理的效用和可接受性(赵等人,2025年),以及对辅助机器人接受程度的系统审查(琼斯等人,2025年)。
